  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我们的Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism 发电机是 Mekanism 的官方附属模组，新增了多种发电机及能量生产方式。若未安装本模块，你需要借助其他模组才能为 Mekanism 的机器提供能量。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">特性：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">热力发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">气体燃烧发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">生物质发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">太阳能发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">高级太阳能发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">风力发电机</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">裂变反应堆</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">聚变反应堆</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">涡轮机</span></li>\n</ul><p><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模组链接：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism 附加</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism 工具</span></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>文档</strong> 可在 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基</a> 上查阅，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 慷慨托管！维基仍在建设中，欢迎贡献内容！</p><p><strong>源代码</strong> 托管于 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong>！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>支持开发团队</strong> 通过 Patreon：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>支持开发团队</strong> 通过 Ko-fi：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
